<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">National Patriotic Front of Liberia</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1989–1997</span> · Also known as NPFL</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The National Patriotic Front of Liberia was a rebel movement led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-taylor-liberia">Charles Taylor</a> that invaded Liberia from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ivory-coast">Côte d'Ivoire</a> in December 1989, starting the First Liberian Civil War. It soon controlled most of the countryside, and after the 1996 peace agreement Taylor turned it into a political party and won the presidential election of 1997.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/national-patriotic-front-of-liberia.jpg" alt="National Patriotic Front of Liberia" width="320" height="293" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown authorUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:National_Patriotic_Front_of_Liberia_Scorpion_Logo.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
